      "statement": "The loader base class converts PDFs to page images with pypdfium2 at a default 300/72 scale, captures URLs as Playwright screenshots using a configurable screenshot_timeout, resizes images to max_image_size, and splits tall images vertically into ~1000px chunks with URL chunks reported as page 0.",
